    stringRef: {fileID: 0}
    stringVal:
  startIndex: 0
  callMode: 0
--- !u!114 &114274335943731223
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1386773078381506}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 608
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 再加上几个门派间也都是{color=#d0380a}貌合神离{/color}，真要遇到什么危险，大家还是以各自门派的利益为重。如此一来，每一届的猎魔试炼确实都会有人命丧其中。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114356296411290796}
  AvatarIntID: 417
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114192511674091974
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1386773078381506}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 632
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 其实能够结成六、七品金丹的，已是数一数二的佼佼者，我派数位长老之中能够有此等机遇者亦不多见。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114356296411290796}
  AvatarIntID: 417
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
